<figure id="LST2" class="ltx_float ltx_lstlisting ltx_minipage ltx_align_middle" style="width:345.0pt;">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_float">Listing 2: </span>System and user messages for the sentiment and factcheck datasets of the verified generation experiments, with <math id="LST2.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{\mathcal{M}}^{\rm{ref}}=\modelPhiThreeFiveInstruct" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℳ</mi><mi>ref</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mtext class="ltx_font_smallcaps">phi3.5</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\mathcal{M}}^{\rm{ref}}=\modelPhiThreeFiveInstruct</annotation></semantics></math>. The document text replaces TEXT for each instance.</figcaption>
<div id="LST2.2" class="ltx_listing ltx_lstlisting ltx_framed ltx_framed_rectangle ltx_listing"><div class="ltx_listing_data"><a href="data:text/plain;base64," download="">⬇</a></div>
<div id="lstnumberx24" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="lstnumberx24.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">&lt;|</span><span id="lstnumberx24.2" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">system</span><span id="lstnumberx24.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">|&gt;</span>
</div>
